      "text": "Built-in agent presets intentionally launch CLIs in bypass/non-interactive modes (e.g. `--dangerously-skip-permissions` for Claude Code, `--yolo` for Gemini), so workers can run arbitrary shell commands in the workspace; Hive provides no sandboxing or multi-user auth."
