      ],
      "text": "Optional Remote access (off by default) pairs a phone to the desktop via a desktop-confirmed pairing flow and relays through an end-to-end encrypted gateway; paired devices have the same authority as the local browser and can be revoked, and CLI subcommands like `hive remote login/status/devices/revoke` manage it."
